zeebx: the CPU's frame into the frontend's framebuffer on the GPU path (dArkOS RG52 Mini)

RetroArch's gl driver on GLES presents the hardware FBO and ignores pixels: a frame the
GPU did not draw (2D, as Action Hero 3D's opening) came out black. The frame goes up into
an RGB565 texture and is blitted into the frontend's framebuffer. Ported on 2026-11-21 to
v0.6.0, where the libretro frontend was translated to English; the logic is unchanged.

